OL,3,GNEWSABoy knife attacker will not give
OL,4,Aevidence in trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenage boy who stabbed a girl in a
OL,7,Fmasked attack at a school will not give
OL,8,Fevidence during his trial, a court has
OL,9,Fheard.
OL,11,FNorfolk Police was called to Thorpe St
OL,12,FAndrew School, near Norwich, on 11
OL,13,FMarch following reports a 15-year-old
OL,14,Fhad been stabbed in the back.
OL,16,FThe defendant, who is 16 and cannot be
OL,17,Fnamed for legal reasons, denies
OL,18,Fattempted murder, but has admitted
OL,19,Fpossessing a kitchen knife without
OL,20,Flawful authority and wounding with
OL,21,Fintent.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,377,370,200,160,0,100
