OL,3,GNEWSABoy knife attacker will not give
OL,4,Aevidence in trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FStephen Rose KC, for the defence,
OL,7,Fconfirmed to the jury that the boy
OL,8,Fwould not be giving evidence at King's
OL,9,FLynn Crown Court.
